{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 346 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Leucovorin calcium has been on FDA's shortage list since 2012-01-01 and as of 2026-10-21 has been listed for 178 months.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 709567 at the Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. plant (FEI 1510690) ended 2011-01-20 and was classified VAI, 346 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2009-03-30, 1007 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 50 mg/5 mL injection vials used at Corvale East, Corvale General, and Corvale Lakeside are labeled with NDC 25021081310 from Sagent Pharmaceuticals, manufactured at SAGENT PHARMS.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E6", "E7", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 350 mg/17.5 mL injection vials used at Corvale East and Corvale General are labeled with NDC 00143955201 from Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., manufactured at HIKMA FARMACÊUTICA (PORTUGAL) and West-Ward Columbus Inc.",
      "cites": ["E2", "E5", "E15", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 2.7 days of the 50 mg/5 mL presentation on hand, while Corvale Lakeside has 24.5 days and Corvale General has 23.2 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The highest-ranked option is to transfer 8 vials of 50 mg/5 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 5 days on hand while Corvale Lakeside retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    }
  ]
}
